{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09338","headline":"秋夕西斋与僧神静游 · 韦应物","name":"秋夕西斋与僧神静游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨登西斋望，不觉至夕曛。\n正当秋夏交，原野起烟氛。\n坐听凉飙举，华月稍披云。\n漠漠山犹隐，灩灩川始分。\n物幽夜更殊，境静兴弥臻。\n息机非傲世，于时乏嘉闻。\n究空自爲理，况与释子羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09338.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09338","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}